{"author":{"id":"1949ffc23f11a8cb4f8c42a45c9ad241b49570df9a18687489e9ea78d87c54a3"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1773178658,"nonce":"8fWtRjv4iAVDQoWjmIkhh26nYlQ=","title":"CDE deferred enterSubgraph navigation silently lost when registry loads after user navigates away","message":"The _isRegistryLoaded guard in enterSubgraph correctly defers when registry is not loaded. But when the registry later loads and setComponentRegistry fires, nothing re-invokes enterSubgraph for the deferred node. The user must double-click again with no indication of why their first click failed. Fix: have setComponentRegistry check for any pending deferred composites and replay the enterSubgraph for them.","files":null}]}